<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Central European begun.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Central European begun.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities started coverage of Central European Equity Fund Inc with a hold rating, a source at the brokerage firm said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- The fund was off 1/16 to 25.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
